[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们拼命奔跑，<br>最后来到了森林中的湖畔。|#0105Adv07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:湖面仍然和昨晚一样结着冰，<br>只有这附近还有积雪。|#0105Adv07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……原来才只是昨晚发生的事）|#0105Adv07_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那时候亚里沙还活着，还在受苦）|#0105Adv07_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果能早点发现真相，<br>　也许亚里沙就不会死了……）|#0105Adv07_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么这里在下雪啊！！去死啊！<br>差不多得了吧！！下雪！很冷的好吗！！|#0105Adv07_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可可，别那么大声。|#0105Adv07_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在追兵似乎还没到这边来，<br>我们就在这附近找个藏身的地方吧。|#0105Adv07_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR13,ArmL10

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……|#0105Adv07_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:一听到“藏身”这个词，<br>可可就像受到了惊吓般猛地挺直了背。|#0105Adv07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……抱歉吓到你了。|#0105Adv07_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在，监牢的管理者们正在寻找我们。<br>刚才我也看到了猫头鹰……|#0105Adv07_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们压低声音，<br>四处寻找可以藏身的地方。|#0105Adv07_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:——艾玛，可可，<br>我们藏在这里吧。|#0105Adv07_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:找了一会后，<br>玛格指向了一棵大树的树洞。|#0105Adv07_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，要、要进这种地方吗……？<br>看起来很窄，而且会痛吧……|#0105Adv07_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:现在还有时间说这个吗？<br>必须尽可能减少被发现的风险。|#0105Adv07_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:……但是，那个……|#0105Adv07_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:可可……？|#0105Adv07_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛用余光看到，<br>可可表现出了和平时性格完全不符的强烈恐惧。|#0105Adv07_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格环顾四周，<br>捡起了附近的一块木板。|#0105Adv07_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:进去以后，就把这个挡在入口处吧。<br>来，艾玛、可可，快藏起来。|#0105Adv07_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，玛格你呢……？|#0105Adv07_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:这个洞里塞不下三个人的。<br>我去找别的地方藏起来。|#0105Adv07_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可、可是……|#0105Adv07_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没时间讨论了。<br>被发现就完蛋了。<br>快点藏起来。|#0105Adv07_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格……|#0105Adv07_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:好啦快点。|#0105Adv07_Margo013| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在玛格的催促下，艾玛只好爬进树洞。<br>而可可——还在犹豫。|#0105Adv07_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Fearful1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:可可，别发呆了快进去。|#0105Adv07_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……我……呜呜……|#0105Adv07_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:还是说你想去找别的地方躲着？<br>如果是这样的话，我倒是求之不得。|#0105Adv07_Margo015| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我进去！|#0105Adv07_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可虽然脸色发青，但还是选择了<br>能让自己多一分生存机会的选项。|#0105Adv07_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她急忙在艾玛身边并排坐下。|#0105Adv07_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

