; ========================================
; 穴の中に隠れている為、真っ暗な状態
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:木板立起来挡住洞口之后，洞内顿时一片漆黑。<br>紧接着，玛格的脚步声渐渐远去。|#0105Adv07_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（玛格……谢谢你……）|#0105Adv07_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛被少女们背叛过无数次，<br>心灵早已千疮百孔。|#0105Adv07_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但即便如此，艾玛还是被玛格的善意打动，<br>不由得心生感激。|#0105Adv07_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 時間経過
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:躲在树洞里没过多久，<br>就听到了熟悉的翅膀扇动声。|#0105Adv07_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:噫……|#0105Adv07_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_23_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是典狱长……！<br>　已经到附近了！）|#0105Adv07_Ema010|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ずるずる引きずる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_5 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，听到某种可怕的东西靠近的声音。<br>看守也在。|#0105Adv07_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哪怕是发出一点点动静就完蛋了。<br>艾玛更加蜷缩身体，屏住呼吸。|#0105Adv07_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:噫、噫……|#0105Adv07_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎是恐惧过度难以忍受，<br>惨叫声几乎要冲出可可的喉咙。|#0105Adv07_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛立即用手捂住了可可的嘴。|#0105Adv07_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:噫、噫、噫、噫<br>噫、噫、噫、噫|#0105Adv07_Coco013| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可可到底怎么了……？<br>　不太对劲……）|#0105Adv07_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 野外で近づいてくる足音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_73 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐——，可可小姐——，玛格小姐——|#0105Adv07_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露那怯生生颤抖着的声音传来了。<br>|#0105Adv07_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你们去哪里了……<br>我很担心你们，快出来吧——|#0105Adv07_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那仿佛什么都没发生过的声音<br>既令人恐惧，又让艾玛心痛。|#0105Adv07_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（梅露露，竟然就是<br>　管理这个监牢的幕后黑手……）|#0105Adv07_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那么多人被杀了。<br>　她们被判为魔女，化作了【残骸】）|#0105Adv07_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（明明大家都没有错……）|#0105Adv07_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（大魔女到底是什么？<br>　凭什么为了那种东西，<br>　非要牺牲我们不可……？）|#0105Adv07_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……呼……这里也没有呢……|#0105Adv07_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今天要不就到这里吧？<br>我有点累了……|#0105Adv07_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不行。绝对不能放弃……<br>必须找到大家。<br>请彻底搜索每个角落……|#0105Adv07_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唉……这不就是所谓的无偿加班吗……？<br>好吧，我知道了……|#0105Adv07_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说话的声音渐渐远去。<br>艾玛和可可没有被发现，暂时度过了危机。|#0105Adv07_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; ========================================
; 時間経過
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_24_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:心、心、心理创伤这种东西，大家都有吧？|#0105Adv07_Coco014| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:把脸埋在膝盖里的可可，<br>突然喃喃自语。|#0105Adv07_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的言语断断续续，时不时地猛然抽气。|#0105Adv07_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可……？|#0105Adv07_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾、蕾、蕾雅亲也是这样。<br>她那种对引人注目的执着，很不正常。<br>我、我觉得她肯定以前有什么心理创伤。|#0105Adv07_Coco015| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那家伙说，制造魔女必须施加压力。<br>大、大、大家，被挖开心理创伤就会变成魔女啊。|#0105Adv07_Coco016| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛听了这话，<br>确实也有些感同身受。|#0105Adv07_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我我也是……<br>有些特别受不了的事……|#0105Adv07_Coco017| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:像这样【躲藏】的时候，<br>胸口就好像要爆炸一样……|#0105Adv07_Coco018| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎、怎么会这样——<br>难道，这就是可可你的心理创伤……？|#0105Adv07_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛急切地问道，<br>但可可只是不断地浅呼吸，<br>似乎没有余力正常回答。|#0105Adv07_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我只想安心啦。<br>我又想在一旁观望大家，又想受到大家关注。|#0105Adv07_Coco019| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不行了。我不能一直躲着……<br>真的受不了，要哭了……我，可能要死了。|#0105Adv07_Coco020| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛无言以对。|#0105Adv07_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不久，可可用湿润的眼睛看着艾玛。<br>她气喘吁吁，一点点地说道。|#0105Adv07_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……艾、艾玛，艾玛亲，我有个请求。|#0105Adv07_Coco021| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我，很讨厌所谓的友情。<br>但也只能，拜托艾玛亲了……|#0105Adv07_Coco022| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如、如、如果，如果我不行了，<br>能不能拜托你照顾我推……？|#0105Adv07_Coco023| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……【我推】……？|#0105Adv07_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我自己已经无所谓了。<br>但是，还是对我推放心不下。|#0105Adv07_Coco024| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:拜托了，请陪在他身边。<br>他一直都很孤独。<br>他每天都会对着我的照片说话——|#0105Adv07_Coco025| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我最喜欢他了。他对我很重要。<br>他就是我的整个世界。|#0105Adv07_Coco026| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……可可的【推】是……|#0105Adv07_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不想说。虽然不想说。<br>因为爱啊什么的，那种漂亮话，太没意思了。|#0105Adv07_Coco027| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……但我真的很喜欢他。<br>……他是我仅剩的，最后的家人。<br>……我的爷爷。|#0105Adv07_Coco028| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊……原来是这样啊）|#0105Adv07_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自从被关进这个监牢以来，<br>可可有几次像是自言自语般地和谁对话。|#0105Adv07_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那一定是因为可可的家人，<br>正在对着可可的照片说话吧。|#0105Adv07_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:拜托了，求你了艾玛亲。|#0105Adv07_Coco029| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯，我知道了。<br>可可的爷爷……<br>不，可可的【推】，我一定会去见他的。|#0105Adv07_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛已经无法说出“让我们一起活着回去”这种话了。<br>为了稍微减轻可可的心理负担，<br>艾玛只能强忍着泪水作出了承诺。|#0105Adv07_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你艾玛亲。|#0105Adv07_Coco030| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我啊，其实不讨厌这里的生活。<br>虽然只有一点点吧，<br>但我感觉大家就像家人一样。|#0105Adv07_Coco031| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以艾玛亲，也许也是我的【推】呢。|#0105Adv07_Coco032| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你可别死啊。要遵守约定啊。|#0105Adv07_Coco033| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……|#0105Adv07_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可无力地用拳头抵住胸口。|#0105Adv07_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的手，颤抖得更厉害了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……这绝不是单纯的恐惧能够解释的状态。|#0105Adv07_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:树洞里明明不冷，但她却牙齿打颤，<br>全身都在剧烈颤抖。|#0105Adv07_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可可……不行，再这样下去<br>　可可的精神会崩溃的……）|#0105Adv07_Ema023|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：ココの立ち絵（半クリーチャー）表示
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛偷看可可的脸，<br>发现她的脸上出现了裂痕。|#0105Adv07_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:！……可、可可……<br>你的脸，怎、怎么回事……？|#0105Adv07_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛摇晃着可可，<br>可可却像是在说梦话一样喃喃自语。|#0105Adv07_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我啊……<br>看来真的不行了。|#0105Adv07_Coco034| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要【躲藏】，<br>就会想起已经忘了的事。<br>那天……啊，是怎么了来着。|#0105Adv07_Coco035| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刀啊、血啊、尖叫声什么的，<br>还有那家伙寻找我的眼神……|#0105Adv07_Coco036| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哈哈，咦……？<br>我，是不是正在魔女化……？|#0105Adv07_Coco037| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛无从得知<br>可可过去究竟经历了什么。|#0105Adv07_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（已经到了这种程度……<br>　不能再躲藏了……）|#0105Adv07_Ema025|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可振作点！<br>来、来，我们从这里出去吧！|#0105Adv07_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么……？为什么不能躲起来呢……？<br>啊啊对了，我想起来了。|#0105Adv07_Coco038| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，啊，啊啊啊啊啊啊，对了、<br>对了……|#0105Adv07_Coco039| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……是【那一天】啊。|#0105Adv07_Coco040| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:可可带着又像哭又像笑的可悲表情，<br>凝视着艾玛。|#0105Adv07_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛意识到，已经来不及了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经踏入了可可的禁忌——|#0105Adv07_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

