[PrintTextModified Text:爸爸、妈妈，还有比自己小很多的弟弟。|#0105Adv07_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们是非常非常平凡的一家人。|#0105Adv07_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每天平静得有些无聊，但也不坏。|#0105Adv07_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这样平凡的家庭里，只有我<br>不知不觉间拥有了一点点奇特的能力。|#0105Adv07_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要有人在看着我，我就能<br>以俯瞰的视角看到那个画面。|#0105Adv07_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不一定要直接看到我。<br>就算只是我的影像或照片，<br>只要有人在看着我。|#0105Adv07_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我就能俯瞰到那个人。|#0105Adv07_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我能窥视别人的秘密。<br>能调查喜欢的男生的信息。|#0105Adv07_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:消息灵通的我，在男生女生中都很吃香。|#0105Adv07_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多么美妙的魔法啊！|#0105Adv07_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，这美好的日子在某一天轻易地崩塌了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一个杀人狂闯入家中，<br>莫名其妙地残杀了我的家人。|#0105Adv07_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.5 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 AppearanceAndTransition:210_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@WaitForNextFrame

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills Loop:false ScenePositionX:30 ScenePositionY:50 Duration:30
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:我躲进了衣柜里。|#0105Adv07_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到楼下的爸爸被杀，<br>我慌忙钻了进去。|#0105Adv07_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:杀人狂在家里肆虐。|#0105Adv07_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我藏在衣服堆里，拼命屏住呼吸。|#0105Adv07_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吱呀、吱呀、吱呀，<br>杀人狂上楼的声音。|#0105Adv07_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好可怕。|#0105Adv07_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:妈妈也被发现，被刺死了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:弟弟也被发现，被刺死了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那时，爸爸和妈妈<br>都看着家里的全家福照片。|#0105Adv07_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我——|#0105Adv07_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2.5 Duration:0.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 AppearanceAndTransition:210_1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:全都看到了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被迫看到了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:他们是如何被杀害的。|#0105Adv07_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:肉体被撕裂，<br>鲜血飞溅，痛苦、呻吟、喘息，<br>直到生命的最后一刻。|#0105Adv07_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:210_1 SubId:Front
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起、对不起、对不起。<br>只有我一个人躲起来，真的很抱歉。|#0105Adv07_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:求求你们，不要再看我了。<br>不要再让我看到这些了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多么可怕的魔法啊。|#0105Adv07_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

