[PrintTextModified Text:我、我、我、我——|#0105Adv07_Coco041| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可的身体发出咔嚓咔嚓的声响不断变形。<br>伴随着一阵呻吟，她变成了令人毛骨悚然的怪物。|#0105Adv07_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:呃——！|#0105Adv07_Ema027| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

