[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛惊恐万分，慌忙从洞里跳了出来。|#0105Adv07_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:化为怪物的可可紧追其后。<br>|#0105Adv07_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那双已经丧失理智的眼睛，死死盯住眼前的猎物，<br>发出野兽般低沉的咆哮，涎水不住地从嘴角滴落。|#0105Adv07_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆異形化

; @char Coco.Angry pos:50

[PrintTextModified Text:咕哦哦哦哦！！|#0105Adv07_Coco042| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（来不及了——）|#0105Adv07_Ema028| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @hideChars

[PrintTextModified Text:面对扑面袭来的可可，<br>艾玛只能本能地用手臂护住身体。|#0105Adv07_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:她紧闭双眼，等待即将到来的痛苦。|#0105Adv07_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——然而，预想中的疼痛和冲击<br>并没有降临。|#0105Adv07_Narrative082| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

