[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小心翼翼地睁开眼睛，<br>惊讶地发现玛格挺身而出，挡在了自己面前。|#0105Adv07_Narrative083| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格！？|#0105Adv07_Ema029| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格的腹部，<br>被可可伸得长长的手臂贯穿了。|#0105Adv07_Narrative084| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:利爪穿透了玛格的身体，<br>从背后刺了出来。|#0105Adv07_Narrative085| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆刺された状態

[PrintTextModified Text:你在、发什么呆……<br>快逃啊！！|#0105Adv07_Margo016| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格咬紧牙关，拼命抓住可可的手臂，<br>努力控制着肆虐的可可，向艾玛大喊。|#0105Adv07_Narrative086| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆異形化

[PrintTextModified Text:咕哦哦哦哦！！|#0105Adv07_Coco043| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可疯狂地挣扎着，<br>大量的血滴落在地上，<br>变成了颜色鲜艳的蝴蝶。|#0105Adv07_Narrative087| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:咳咳……|#0105Adv07_Margo017| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来我，还没有变成魔女呢。<br>本来还期待着不会死……真遗憾啊。|#0105Adv07_Margo018| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格痛苦地扭曲着脸庞，一边咳着血<br>一边艰难地挤出声音。|#0105Adv07_Narrative088| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她艰难地转向艾玛，<br>试图挤出一个笑容，<br>却透着掩藏不住的悲伤。|#0105Adv07_Narrative089| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来我要以人类的身份死去了。|#0105Adv07_Margo019| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要！！不要啊，玛格！！|#0105Adv07_Ema030| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么要保护我！？为什么！！|#0105Adv07_Ema031| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……真是的……<br>我本来想着，就算只剩我一个人也要活下去的。|#0105Adv07_Margo020| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么要……救你呢……<br>明明没有任何好处……|#0105Adv07_Margo021| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到可可袭击你，<br>下意识地……就想要救你……|#0105Adv07_Margo022| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格微微一笑。|#0105Adv07_Narrative090| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我呢……这辈子几乎没有相信过任何人。|#0105Adv07_Margo023| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也不相信你。<br>一直在等着看你这个总说漂亮话、想要帮助别人的人<br>在某个时刻露出真面目。|#0105Adv07_Margo024| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别说了！快回到你平常若无其事的样子！<br>快站起来，告诉我这一切都是假的……！|#0105Adv07_Ema032| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不管怎么摇晃玛格的身体，<br>都只有大量的血汨汨流淌。|#0105Adv07_Narrative091| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……其实呢。<br>我并不讨厌你说的那些漂亮话。|#0105Adv07_Margo025| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然一直努力不去相信……<br>但现在，我有点想试着相信你了。|#0105Adv07_Margo026| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是你，<br>也许真的能够拯救我们。|#0105Adv07_Margo027| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我很感谢你，<br>让我做了一个美梦。|#0105Adv07_Margo028| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……玛格……别离开我！<br>别留下我一个人！|#0105Adv07_Ema033| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:逃吧……就算只剩你一个人，<br>也一定要活下去……|#0105Adv07_Margo029| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……在最差的时机……说出了真心话、呢。|#0105Adv07_Margo030| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

